<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>Reset your KinShip password</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F6F4EC;">
<span style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;color:#F6F4EC;">Choose a new password. The link works for 1 hour.</span>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F6F4EC" style="width:100%;background-color:#F6F4EC;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9E0DB;border-radius:12px;">
<tr><td bgcolor="#1E4D4A" style="padding:18px 28px;background-color:#1E4D4A;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;">
<img src="https://tree.hale.example/email/logo.png" width="81" height="30" alt="KinShip" style="display:block;width:81px;height:30px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;">
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:28px 28px 10px 28px;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:31px;font-weight:600;color:#17231F;">Reset your password</h1><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#17231F;">Someone asked to reset the password for the KinShip account marcus@hale.example on the Hale Family tree. If that was you, choose a new password below.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 18px 0;"><tr><td bgcolor="#1E4D4A" style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#1E4D4A;"><a href="https://tree.hale.example/reset/SAMPLE-not-a-real-link" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Choose a new password</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#5B6A65;word-break:break-word;">This link works once and expires in 1 hour. A new request cancels it. If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser: https://tree.hale.example/reset/SAMPLE-not-a-real-link</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;margin:4px 0 0 0;border-top:1px solid #D9E0DB;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 0 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#17231F;">Good to know</p><ul style="margin:0;padding:0 0 0 18px;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#17231F;"><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your current password keeps working.</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">KinShip never emails your password and never asks for it.</li></ul></td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:16px 8px 0 8px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5B6A65;text-align:center;">Sent by the Hale Family tree on KinShip (https://tree.hale.example).</p><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5B6A65;text-align:center;">Nobody can use this email without the link, and it stops working once it has been used.</p>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>